 - **Great Generals — prefer Military Instructor, focus on hammer hubs:** AI now favours settling Great Generals as **Military Instructors** over attaching them as unit leaders, as the instructor bonus scales better into the late game. **Targeting:** strong bias to the **top 3 hammer cities** with **decreasing weights** (top-1 most, then top-2/3 progressively less). Extra preference if the city **has / is building** the **Heroic Epic effect** building. **Limit removed:** cities may host **multiple** Military Instructors (no per-city cap). Implemented in `CvCityAI::AI_permanentSpecialistValue` and `CvUnitAI::AI_generalMove`. See [KI#69](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#69---tremendously-improved-ai-going-for-great-general-leaders-while-military-instructors-are-much-better-with-added-logic-to-favour-top-hammer-cities-remove-military-instructor-per-city-limit-favour-it-further-if-have-or-building-heroic-epic-effect-building-etc).
-- Update: (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 6032+) Rarely in games, for example in save file 450 with France AI, a Great General could be attached to a low-value Longbowman at ~T130. BBAI logging showed the cause was Military Instructor joining was blocked by safety/path gates. To fix it, Great General unit-attachment branches now use tunable minimum target gates that default very high, so Great Generals effectively keep preferring Military Instructor or Military Academy unless these thresholds are deliberately lowered. In the retest after fix, those low-value Longbowman attachments were rejected (and another Great General attachment to USA in the same run that newly occurred as well at ~T180 was successfully blocked) and the Great Generals joined cities as Military Instructors instead. See [KI#69 (Update)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#69---tremendously-improved-ai-going-for-great-general-leaders-while-military-instructors-are-much-better-with-added-logic-to-favour-top-hammer-cities-remove-military-instructor-per-city-limit-favour-it-further-if-have-or-building-heroic-epic-effect-building-etc). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 6032+) Update 2: **Great General safety/reliability:** fixed several inherited Base AdvCiv pitfalls that could spawn, route or leave defenseless Great Generals in danger before the AI could use them, and made the additional Military Instructor-first priority era-tunable. See [KI#204](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#204---fixedimproved-base-advciv-great-general-birth-safety-and-reporting-gaps-could-waste-free-great-generals-including-unsafe-birth-city-selection-and-an-inverted-military-academy-city-safety-test).
